Write a solution to find the daily active user count for a period of 30 days ending 2019-07-27 inclusively. 
A user was active on someday if they made at least one activity on that day.
Return the result table in any order.


SOLUTION:

SELECT activity_date day, COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) active_users
FROM Activity
GROUP BY activity_date -- grouping for the count
HAVING DATEDIFF('2019-07-27', activity_date) BETWEEN 0 AND 29 -- this checks the amount of days between the two and confirms that no greater than a month has passed
